WEBVTT

00:13:57.829 --> 00:14:01.037
She sent me a mock up of how she thought
my homepage should be redesigned.

00:14:01.579 --> 00:14:03.162
I wasn't even looking for a change,

00:14:03.371 --> 00:14:06.162
but she did such a great job that
I hired her on the spot.

00:14:06.912 --> 00:14:10.787
Not everyone will have time to experiment
like this, but if you can manage it,

00:14:10.787 --> 00:14:13.537
it's a promising way to proactively
change the situation.

00:14:14.329 --> 00:14:16.996
There's evidence that side hustles
can boost our engagement

00:14:16.996 --> 00:14:21.579
and performance in our full time jobs, and
sometimes they even become a career.

00:14:21.871 --> 00:14:26.787
Go do that thing that excites you. If you
are an architect, go draw blueprints.

00:14:27.121 --> 00:14:29.829
If you're an auto mechanic,
go fix everybody's cars.

00:14:29.829 --> 00:14:33.579
And if you do that long enough
and you do it well enough,